1
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:50,799
Xiang Kun, what are you doing?

2
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:51,719
Xiang Kun!

3
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,079
You still dare to rebel?

4
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,040
Young Master.

5
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,560
Li Xiao just shot his own man.

6
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:14,760
Then another tripped over
the wild boar snare.

7
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,280
Miss Mei walked around in her white dress,

8
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,319
and they were scared out of their wits.

9
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:18,879
I saw it.

10
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,239
Those guys...

11
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,799
were scared to death by their own fear.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,840
Let's go.

13
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,400
Let's figure out how to play
with them longer.

14
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,920
Chun'er, what happened?

15
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,319
There was a slight incident just now.

16
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,079
But luckily, it was just a scare.

17
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,680
I heard gunshots from behind us earlier.

18
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,799
Could Zhang Tianyou and his men
be in trouble?

19
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,359
Young Master!

20
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,560
This won't work!

21
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,920
They've got guns and cannons,

22
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,599
while we've only got shovels
and crappy torches.

23
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:54,920
We can't fight them head-on.

24
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,079
We need a plan.

25
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:56,959
Fighting head-on

26
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,680
is for brainless brutes.

27
00:01:59,359 --> 00:02:01,120
Have you forgotten how we started out?

28
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,040
Let's show them our old trade.

29
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:05,840
Show them what "My turf, my rules" means.

30
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,519
Let's go.

31
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:21,120
Father, they're over there.

32
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,479
Let's go.

33
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,759
What if there's an ambush?

34
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,439
Father.

35
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,680
In the face of absolute power,

36
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,400
those are just petty tricks.

37
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:30,159
Alright, we'll do as you say.

38
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:30,759
Let's go.

39
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,719
Something's wrong.

40
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,840
The magnetic field here is distorted.

41
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,400
Impossible.

42
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,240
Marshal Li.

43
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,120
Look at the soldiers behind you.

44
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,400
Don't they look completely dazed?

45
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:12,520
This place is filled with natural miasma.

46
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,439
Trying to act tough with me?

47
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:14,879
I...

48
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,960
Focus! Recite the Heart-Clearing Mantra.

49
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,840
Steady!

50
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:38,080
Father!

51
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:40,919
Go!

52
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:41,479
Go!

53
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,960
Father!

54
00:03:44,159 --> 00:03:45,639
I'll kill you all!

55
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,319
Father!

56
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,879
Father, are you alright?

57
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,199
Father!

58
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,000
I...

59
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,400
I'm not gonna make it.

60
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,800
Li Xiao...

61
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,800
Li Xiao.

62
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:02,919
You...

63
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,840
must remember...

64
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,240
Father!

65
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,759
Remember what, Father?

66
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,120
Father!

67
00:04:11,719 --> 00:04:12,560
Well...

68
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,319
Remember what?

69
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,560
Anyone still breathing?

70
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,160
Follow me.

71
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,800
Zhang Tianyou.

72
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,959
My men have followed your orders

73
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:47,079
and scattered around.

74
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:50,480
Guarding the Qian, Kun,
Xun, and Zhen positions.

75
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,360
You exhausted yourself

76
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,839
using the Dragon-Seeking Formula

77
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,040
just to find a piece

78
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,240
of wasteland without even
a single grave mound?

79
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,040
What's the rush, Mei?

80
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:00,639
Haste makes waste.

81
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,519
Tide, tide...

82
00:05:02,519 --> 00:05:04,240
The key is in the word "Tide."

83
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,160
It's not only hidden in the earth,

84
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,240
but also concealed in time.

85
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:13,120
We have to wait for this forest to

86
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,800
breathe.

87
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,199
Breathe?

88
00:05:18,639 --> 00:05:20,439
The Dragon-Seeking Formula states,

89
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:24,319
Dragon's Lair appears at the fated hour.
Yin-Yang Harmony opens the Hidden Court.

90
00:05:26,959 --> 00:05:28,439
Let's wait for this tidal mist to clear.

91
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:29,959
We'll wait.

92
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:47,040
Tianyou

93
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,040
Young Master.

94
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:10,639
Look, this fog is a bit too sinister.

95
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,759
I'm a little scared.

96
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,319
Don't panic.

97
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:28,120
Stargazing has its methods,
dragon-seeking has its formula.

98
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:32,399
Seven Stars set the Celestial Pivot,
the Big Dipper points the dragon's path.

99
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:36,519
Greedy Wolf opens the Dragon Vein,
Martial Star lights the tomb.

100
00:06:36,519 --> 00:06:37,079
Open!

101
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:52,040
It's really here.

102
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:53,800
Great.

103
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:57,720
Shuang'er, Miss Sheng, Chun'er.

104
00:06:57,720 --> 00:07:00,079
All of you women stay outside.

105
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,000
This twenty-year grudge

106
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,759
is for my old bones

107
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:06,160
and the former chief to go in and settle.

108
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:06,959
No, Father.

109
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:07,839
I'm going too.

110
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,439
The dangers inside are unknown.

111
00:07:10,759 --> 00:07:11,879
One more person means more help.

112
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:12,439
No.

113
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:12,759
Father!

114
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:13,519
That's an order.

115
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,240
Fenglin, get your sister ready.

116
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:20,720
Shuang'er, listen to me.

117
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,959
Use your Yin-Yang Eyes to open the door,

118
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:25,199
then stay outside with them as backup.

119
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,000
Okay.

120
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,639
Here.

121
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,399
Here.

122
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,680
Don't worry.

123
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,040
I'll come back alive

124
00:07:43,079 --> 00:07:44,120
so you can divorce me.

125
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,480
Chun'er.

126
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:06,839
Wan Chun'er's occipital lobe is
more developed than average.

127
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:09,279
If she concentrates,

128
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:11,240
she can see things ordinary people can't.

129
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,600
But it's also extremely draining.

130
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:14,920
Can you handle it?

131
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,600
This one...

132
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,879
Chun'er.

133
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:36,440
We only have one chance
to crack this mechanism.

134
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,200
Are you sure?

135
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,279
I'm positive, Tianyou.

136
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:39,080
It's this one.

137
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:06,159
We've used one of the
Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye.

138
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,559
Let's go.

139
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,399
Let's see what

140
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:14,039
the nightmare and truth that have plagued

141
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,759
the four families for 20 years really are.

142
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:59,960
The mantis stalks the cicada,
but the oriole lurks behind.

143
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,080
Zhang Tianyou.

144
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,960
You really did see all of this coming.

145
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:32,759
You're still planning to make a move
on Zhang Tianyou?

146
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,279
That's right.

147
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:37,440
It's either I kill him,

148
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,799
or he kills us.

149
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:43,399
If he enters that tomb,

150
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:49,000
he'll find out everything.

151
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,440
Young Master.

152
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,320
So this is the lair of that evil thing.

153
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,600
It's even shabbier than
my cellar back home.

154
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,200
What is all this?

155
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,200
It's been dead for too long,

156
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,480
so long that even the air forgot to flow.

157
00:11:12,799 --> 00:11:16,440
But some things are still
very much alive and kicking.

158
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,440
Patriarch Mei,
we've been walking for a while.

159
00:11:21,679 --> 00:11:24,279
You're holding onto that weapon
of yours pretty tightly.

160
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,240
Watch out, Young Master!

161
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:30,519
Zhang Tianyou.

162
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:32,080
You're too smart.

163
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,720
So smart that it's frightening.

164
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,879
You already know too much.

165
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,559
Don't go any further.
